# ===========================================================================
# This repo tracks CODE and small irreplaceable INPUTS. It tracks no capture
# data: raw and corrected cubes total ~180 GB and live beside the checkout,
# not in it. PROJECT_REPORT.md, "Reproducing this", says what to copy.
#
# NOTE: git does not support trailing comments on a pattern line. Every
# comment here is on its own line for that reason.
# ===========================================================================

# --------------------------------------------------------- capture data ---
# real_data/  corrected cubes, 163 GB -- the modelling input
# the rest    early exploratory captures, kept beside the checkout
real_data/
data/
archive/
07012026/

# Image trees inside the preprocessing pipeline: raw lines, corrected cubes,
# previews, per-capture renders. Regenerable from the raw archive, and large.
**/raw_image/
**/raw_binaries/
**/preview/
**/preview_coco/
**/reflectance_images/
**/transmittance_images/
**/grid_view/
**/calibration/

